{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0233_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ee525e6630efeef43cae6b3acc79ad98032cef30b8b8171e5120274f5b420361", "ja": "（昨日はみんなで、下町のお祭りを手伝う仕事を\nしてきた。みんな、すごく楽しそうだったな……）", "zh": "（昨天大家一起去帮忙做了下町祭典的工作。\n大家看起来都特别开心呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0233_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "d8064df55b7dedde69ab71f2a24801f23a6b440c7ca398dde1a9f771e3bee2c1", "ja": "{$P$}！　おっはよーう！", "zh": "{$P$}！早～啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0233_1002_p", "source_sha256": "5b4bdea19fbb0e0e452c6fbea958d96ecfaf953f0d3c8c40e5689e83b644a62c", "ja": "おはよう、のり子。昨日は大活躍だったな。\n疲れは残ってないか？", "zh": "早上好，纪子。你昨天表现得非常出色啊。\n没有留下疲劳吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0233_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "9a7de7de2c7d0e680f4d9a18de9209d9deb233b0c740a573b5e2e0c96bc23c1c", "ja": "てやんでぇっ♪　あの程度でくたびれちまうほど、\nヤワな鍛え方はしてないぜっ！", "zh": "少来这套♪！那点程度还不至于把我累趴下！我可没接受过那么软绵绵的训练！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0233_1004_p", "source_sha256": "d9c14851175be799ab5ed47efd068ccdcd18a23544ed828e06a9da9848aca78b", "ja": "お、おお……なんか、いつにも増して勢いがあるな。", "zh": "哦、哦哦……总觉得今天比平时更有气势啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0233_1005_043nor", "source_sha256": "8ab55ae6111f89d91cf45fecd1ee6732d279c2e4071127a9e6a899fdfa0d8f5d", "ja": "あははっ、昨日のお神輿のおじさんたちの\n話し方がうつっちゃって、まだ抜けないみたい。", "zh": "啊哈哈，被昨天抬神轿的大叔们\n说话的调调给传染了，好像还没缓过来呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0233_1006_p", "source_sha256": "c71eed65f5a99ca9276ad20637cda8cd6944447812f19bc0c88cf0440decbd3c", "ja": "昨日ののり子、ノリノリだったもんな。\n神輿の上でもずっと声を上げてて。", "zh": "昨天的乃子真的很嗨呢。\n在神轿上一直大声呼喊着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0233_1007_043nor", "source_sha256": "c733cd965eff2127a9139600d9d9ac2d1787b225b0beeb69c3ba7cffe0220ef4", "ja": "正直最初はさ、アタシがお神輿に乗って、ちゃんと\n盛り上げられるかな～って、少し心配だったけど。", "zh": "说实话，一开始我还有点担心，自己坐上神轿后，能不能好好把气氛炒热起来～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0233_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "245c4e5fd9a07a9bb4f0d5ce3b3a07b25ce85dc2ec59e8f0de7d97d2ed073c38", "ja": "でも、熱くてチャキチャキな人達に囲まれて、\nアタシも一緒に熱くなれたよ。負けてらんないって！", "zh": "不过，被一群热血又干脆利落的人包围着，我也跟着热血起来了。可不能输给他们啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0233_1009_p", "source_sha256": "f7e776433958ca3bf63b2070e9a954c7ae5fc2acf3ac7466eeeea83812a454f4", "ja": "実際、盛り上がったもんな。\nのり子の評判も、凄くよかったよ。", "zh": "现场确实很热闹啊。\n大家对法子的评价也非常棒哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0233_1010_043nor", "source_sha256": "3e7bc0fb87df7f69f228687e1bea8eb14ff937a18eb21a82d813b62f5b70c4fa", "ja": "ホント？　嬉しいな～！　頑張ってよかったよ！\nお神輿、楽しかった！", "zh": "真的？太开心了～！努力果然没有白费！\n抬神轿真的很有意思！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0233_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "3bf8c288395a4c35481ec4cc46b7996027f44d6998abaa08629b19d4857acd86", "ja": "それと……夜の花火大会も、最高に楽しめたな。\nみんなと空を眺めて……いい思い出になったよ。", "zh": "还有……晚上的烟花大会也玩得特别开心。\n和大家一起仰望夜空……成了一段美好的回忆。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0233_1012_043nor", "source_sha256": "cd6ee5795bbd8dd8319ca9c743b4e8bf2d691e5f9e3fdf7eb82e101ab7ecce23", "ja": "{$P$}。改めて、ありがとね。\nお仕事の後、ゆっくりできる時間をくれて。", "zh": "{$P$}。再次谢谢你啊。工作结束后还给了我们好好放松的时间。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0233_1013_p", "source_sha256": "0724160d1b3853e8219a5f16e586f9fb3f6e0b02919c5056a1698c8b40da5dd2", "ja": "いや、それくらいは当たり前だよ。\nみんな頑張ってくれたんだから。", "zh": "不，这点事是理所当然的。\n毕竟大家都很努力了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0233_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "06972885dde234a2a44a9425a5ae23270898feb85616a7f2ce4e7c9556e0a9a6", "ja": "最高のご褒美だったよ！　仲間と一緒に\n見る花火はさ……やっぱ、特別だから！", "zh": "这是最棒的奖励！和伙伴们一起\n看烟火嘛……果然，特别不一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0233_1015_p", "source_sha256": "c480dc953f256858c0e5e80d60ded3986d6f20d7b82b4dc4102674487d21efb6", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。仲間との花火か……。", "zh": "啊，是啊。和伙伴们一起看烟花啊……Ⅱ", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0233_1016_p", "source_sha256": "876bbf32b99bc9dc01dc1b238c8207a6cdc245c5659f7d2b8cb747e2c93e8b7f", "ja": "ファンのみんなと、劇場で花火をするイベントとか、\n面白いかもな。もっとクローズドな感じで。", "zh": "比如和所有粉丝一起在剧场放烟花的活动，也许会很有意思。感觉可以办得更封闭一些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0233_1017_043nor", "source_sha256": "01c44c17c7d465c3813ba1318f098e8a7739a78634d9947806e53b30f9a3937a", "ja": "ファンのみんなと……それ、いいね！\n絶対楽しいし、アタシもすごくやりたい！", "zh": "和粉丝们一起……这个主意不错！\n肯定很开心，我也特别想参加！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0233_1018_043nor", "source_sha256": "b1d97fc863c9fe4d23c9a3b34f1608576cb4c7f355981dcee7ebe01cd493dab3", "ja": "その時は、アタシにも花火を打ち上げさせてよ！\nたまやー！ってね♪", "zh": "到时候也让我来放烟花吧！\n一起喊“玉屋——！”♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
